{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "adc203271ae624ec5056299404f052ed7bc8080e1fc2a4fe8cc1a164c27872bf", "ja": "いろんなやつ", "zh": "各种各样的家伙", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fadf00ddf562ccbb214c86a7e0963c48e9f69126793e8647eed428f92f55318a", "ja": "学業と仕事を両立するため、芸能学校に転入\nする真珠星。そんな真珠星を不思議に思う\nクロエ。だが転入早々、真珠星は真田湊に\n絡まれた写真がSNSにアップされ、炎上。\nクロエは海外デビューに思いを馳せる。", "zh": "为了兼顾学业与工作，真珠星转入\n艺能学校。克洛伊对这样的真珠星感到不解。\n然而才刚转学不久，真珠星被真田凑\n纠缠的照片就被上传到社交平台，引发了非议。\n克洛伊则将思绪寄托在海外出道上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1000_051tmg", "source_sha256": "96bafd409e3b36f913f36093c3b85b8d7af8903b208c305614790b7a535e1e9b", "ja": "お疲れ。\nこの後、自主練してくから、鍵を……。", "zh": "辛苦了。接下来我要自己练习，所以钥匙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "63339347952619bff99ed318a29b195b8c7a20aa935ed9131009ea9bd33c5d51", "ja": "……？\n真珠星が、なんかすごい顔してる。何？", "zh": "……？\n真珠星的表情怎么看起来怪怪的。怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d9ba476f5c739453b1a2088f4bbf1c7c7aa08106122ab9af9e5efa471d74983f", "ja": "学校の課題やってるの！\n学業とアイドル、両立しなきゃでしょ！", "zh": "在做学校的作业啦！\n学业和偶像，两边都得兼顾才行吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4cb37f55553c8ff64677a053afd7601527d9db3c97df033ed827c2632b8eaf66", "ja": "ふーん……そうなんだ。\n大変だね。", "zh": "哦……这样啊。\n真辛苦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "18c6be0ac10d478aae07d818fea7ebec4be27ac5917a32b848582f02cc7e2ffc", "ja": "クロエさんだって、学生でしょ！\n……あれ？　そういえば、みんな学校はどうしてるの？", "zh": "克洛伊不也是学生吗！\n……咦？说起来，大家平时怎么上学呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "4f3d90b033e9625d28413f9d28efd911b23b0d4340b4894a2abc72a3a9c35eb1", "ja": "だいたい芸能学校じゃない？", "zh": "基本上都是演艺学校吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "278289c9a57b907cb8a71596aadc336ab0f48441d8ac04cb22a6500948278f70", "ja": "同じく。ほとんど行ってないけど。", "zh": "我也是。虽然基本没怎么去过就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "33b50efb8249ff705326591b40f51181477fab6033970970a957c01746489f52", "ja": "私も……。", "zh": "我也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0e0a6aa245eea720578d430e738ccce07837bd5ae3871865a2fca2086f8ab762", "ja": "えー！？　聞いてない！　アイドルやるなら、\n絶対そっちの方がいいじゃん！", "zh": "诶——！？我都没听说过！要当偶像的话，绝对是那边更好啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "58ad6b30d57f54cb6f2e9f2e429fb23a9fa0fac1eb9d74de84cd97c79ba9ac4f", "ja": "お金かかるわよ？", "zh": "会花钱的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e1e2433175e95e8eb96afd3ef22b495f1de99b156746547f1c2d70f241763a6a", "ja": "ぐっ……。\nじ、神宮寺さんに相談してみるもん！", "zh": "唔……我、我去找神宫寺小姐商量看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "31073577e87e2ba68ac2d2159058beb5060bb4ab8b3e246c781316b068326985", "ja": "あのっ、もしもし？\n神宮寺さん？", "zh": "那个，请问？\n是神宫寺小姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "97101015e9de3f9144e0d0c085b99a103f9eace71920c261796b05801c376602", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー……\nファイブ、シックス、セブン、エイト……。", "zh": "一、二、三、四……\n五、六、七、八……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d4178145216ed7aa9d1b01b0372195244f499fd7a9406d0df5c568013f9bd3eb", "ja": "（……集中できていい。\n誰もいないレッスン室が、一番落ち着くな……）", "zh": "（……这样正好能集中精神。没有人的练习室，最让人放松了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "216fb1f79e9edb8a81cfb61dad8180fee0c0db9214b161587ca51a8b9ae097df", "ja": "……これも、変人とか言われるのか？\nよくわからないけど。", "zh": "……这样也会被说成是怪人吗？\n虽然我也不太明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cde23c1e8ca31d7d4c2b0e41f9cc447fc71a69c2d8f690255d5a30a4b0823989", "ja": "まあいいか。\n私が目指すこと……やりたいことは、変わらないし。", "zh": "算了，无所谓。\n反正我的目标……我想做的事，并不会改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2fb5344ae41a620441a3153e960b65c8347c5775d06d1f82c2b6929e3cbe07e3", "ja": "……もう一本、いくか。", "zh": "……再来一遍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3d1d59ca4d8fa9cd069b94f99389f59854a408f03d30c9f9775cfbe3e436d2ca", "ja": "（……アイドルやれるのに、学校の勉強も\nちゃんとやりたいなんて。真珠星は、変なやつだ）", "zh": "（……明明能当偶像，却还想好好学习。真珠星这家伙，真奇怪啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3c58bd919ff8491a880b0a6c73d759ef5bed1fe45ee4965febd2e883650e1e2f", "ja": "いろんなやつがいるんだな……。", "zh": "原来有各种各样的人啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0d4720c0985e5e50be3e3273f46176165634cbcf6a0231d58fb7b21471a1b2b3", "ja": "それから数週間後、猛勉強した真珠星は、無事\n転入試験をパス。芸能学校に転入することになった。", "zh": "几周后，拼命学习的真珠星顺利\n通过了转学考试，决定转入艺能学校。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1021_null", "source_sha256": "6277d6354a15dc7319665e415d936c355e998c1341fbec2428563b39bfd4d80c", "ja": "転入初日　放課後……", "zh": "转学第一天　放学后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c31f8b3465e881f44c9d7d22bd4ba14944261affe880d0c78f02cd034cc0680b", "ja": "あ～、もう！　なんでいきなり\nこんなことになるのよ～！？", "zh": "啊～真是的！怎么刚来\n就变成这样了啦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "f211ec0a8b7ebdab018dd5c0a5795aac9ccbabb6f1f908bc690667c2916b4192", "ja": "「真田湊、新たなお気に入り候補！？」\n「ターゲットは一宮織姫の妹！」", "zh": "“真田凑的新宠候选！？”\n“目标是一宫织姬的妹妹！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "e5e379b83519323f5f74ebecd97b7335ec845f8aeec0bc75dad2c3463aa1793c", "ja": "……なかなかの炎上っぷりね。\nまた真田湊と絡んだの？", "zh": "……闹得可真够厉害的呢。\n你又跟真田凑扯上关系了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8c72b59b525912dc7c0469bd160504d8fc6af84741a5865c6aae07ec6730dd53", "ja": "勝手に絡まれたの！！　そこを、真田湊の\nグループの……何とかってやつに撮られて！", "zh": "是他擅自来招惹我的！！结果还被真田湊的团队里……叫什么来着的家伙拍了下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "85f689182ef688917a3f2b4b581288acb7d377a4f23d2fbe9dd930b9196a1b25", "ja": "そいつが、勝手にSNSにアップしたの！\nそうしたら、こんな騒ぎに……！", "zh": "那家伙擅自把视频发到社交平台上了！  \n结果就闹成这样了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8d000bc82af4299cdf12b67c1d686294b579f297c4749e9f3c6956bb96b3dcee", "ja": "私が新しい動画アップした日に被せるなよ。\n再生回数の伸びが悪くなるだろ。", "zh": "你干嘛偏要在我发新视频的那天凑热闹。\n这样播放量不就涨不上去了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7b49d55380b2671e442f36ee727b2c80635f74f09054f36948165b6f2688d1c7", "ja": "好きでやってるわけないでしょ！？\n私だって迷惑してるんだからー！", "zh": "我又不是自己想这么做的！？\n我也很困扰的啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "ee87c30e216369d370a8b2d32a9a3b96b6cc741867a5f04c396cd1be98015509", "ja": "「海外デビューを控えてる湊くんに近づくなんて！」\n……そういえば、あっちはそんな話もあったわね。", "zh": "“竟然敢接近马上就要在海外出道的凑同学！”\n……说起来，那边好像是有这么一回事来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "70d81c1c2e93bf1db8da2b54eb27a73c23f19894067a746c2b8ba89813bc5185", "ja": "関係ないし、知らないんだけど！？　ていうか、\n学校に来ただけで燃えるとか、何なの～！？", "zh": "这跟我又没关系，我也不知道啊！？话说，只是来学校一趟就闹得沸沸扬扬，到底是怎么回事啦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "c888d081d3a69fcdbfed2a3a08da349c344d9a55ddd631265f4f5aa4736baddc", "ja": "その子のSNSは、そういうネタが多いし。ファンも、\n知ってて悪ノリしてるようなものだから……。", "zh": "那个孩子的社交账号上，这种话题很多。而且粉丝们也是明知如此还跟着起哄……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_06_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "9ea801f03b605fb869ecb5df34f7a0a02b578fc82cea8ce19c6f1e8e6f265ac1", "ja": "放っておけば、そのうち鎮火するんじゃないかな……？", "zh": "放着不管的话，过一阵子应该就会平息了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
